{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、お久しぶりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pとしてちょっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の乃木坂46について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに運営ブログで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご報告させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎研究生として復帰した相楽伊織ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/07/21/7310629/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I♡HinaKawagoって書いてある♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のこと好きなのかな？(絶対違う)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しメンは、秋元真夏らしい(°_°)う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、そんなことはさておき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中加入・復帰ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと不安も沢山あるとおもうので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひあたたかく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援・見守ってあげてくださいね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎新しい試み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都にて全国握手会が行われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当初予定では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話会と変更とお知らせがありましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブを無くして通常の全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をするという形になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく乃木坂46に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr